silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_03_dependency_and_mittens_legs_concrete_anchor_8 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_dependency_and_mittens_legs #8', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Dependencies and \\(\\Mittens\\) Source Legs' the bare symbol ProcLeg anchors to MittensVetRecordBackendTarget: The backend write target: the storage row where the typed measurement claim lands after routing — the row carries source key, value, date, observer, gate status.." .
